: {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 73, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🌿 Following $SMR $OKLO or $CCJ?\n\n📊 Stay updated on quarterly performance, energy industry trends, and company developments.\n\n👉 WhatsApp: https://t.co/d6bB8DN5ge\n\n💬 Which nuclear energy company is on your radar?\n\n#NuclearEnergy #EnergyStocks🚀 Watching $LUNR $RKLB or $ASTS?", "url": "https://x.com/sdown8upper/status/2113379932814618994"}, {"author_id": "1819378752465653764", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:05:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113376246755475821"], "id": "2113376246755475821", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 33, "impression_count": 14837, "like_count": 181, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 23}, "text": "The nuclear renaissance has been full speed ahead these past few days 🤘\n\n• The Nuclear Co proposes six-reactor Kentucky plant\n• Finland licenses permanent nuclear waste disposal site\n• Indiana studies up to 6 GW CANDU project\n• AEP + Amazon + X-energy 960 MW SMR plant in", "url": "https://x.com/UnoMasReactor/status/2113376246755475821"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113377651369062400", "3_2113377651373297664", "3_2113377651364970496", "3_2113377651356512256"]}, "author_id": "1568654040531144704", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:11:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113377660114223424"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/uGrXk9FoEu", "end": 293, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/discobray/status/2113377660114223424/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113377651369062400", "start": 270, "url": "https://t.co/uGrXk9FoEu"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/uGrXk9FoEu", "end": 293, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/discobray/status/2113377660114223424/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113377651373297664", "start": 270, "url": "https://t.co/uGrXk9FoEu"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/uGrXk9FoEu", "end": 293, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/discobray/status/2113377660114223424/photo/1", "media_key": "