: 3, "reply_count": 49, "retweet_count": 8}, "text": "A fusion startup claims it can turn mercury into gold: you might be able to make gold, but you can't just make Bitcoin\n\n\"Mercury to gold. Marathon Fusion claims 10x CERN record.\"\n\n\"A company in San Francisco turned mercury into actual physical real gold. Alchemy is real.\"\n\n\"We https://t.co/S6GlujzDEg", "url": "https://x.com/scottmelker/status/2113378904853692528"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113375299987730432"]}, "author_id": "1516070938940698624", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:01:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113375308036620720"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 275, "start": 268, "tag": "XAUUSD"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/NgtbBL6BuK", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/itzteekfx/status/2113375308036620720/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113375299987730432", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/NgtbBL6BuK"}]}, "id": "2113375308036620720", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 115, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Artificial Gold‼️\nMarathon Fusion, an American startup, is quietly rewriting the periodic table - turning mercury into pure gold through the raw, untamed power of fusion.\n\nWhen eternal scarcity becomes a clean-energy byproduct, what happens to the ultimate safe-haven $XAUUSD?\n\nIs https://t.co/NgtbBL6BuK", "url": "https://x.com/itzteekfx/status/2113375308036620720"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113384476885561344"]}, "author_id": "1878450272235884544", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:42:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113385560588837362"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/qCrleoKytO", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SDNsmartcity/status/2113385560588837362/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113384476885561344", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/qCrleoKytO"}]}, "id": "2113385560588837362", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 251, "l